{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04144","headline":"孤烛叹 · 徐彦伯","name":"孤烛叹","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"切切夜闺冷，微微孤烛然。\n玉盘红泪滴，金烬彩光圆。\n煖手缝轻素，嚬蛾续断弦。\n相思咽不语，回向锦屏眠。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐彦伯","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04144.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04144","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}